Vein Mining (Itamio Fabric port)
Unofficial port of Vein Mining by illusivesoulworks
(https://github.com/illusivesoulworks/veinmining, LGPL-3.0-only,
9.7M downloads on Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.21). All credit to
illusivesoulworks. Fabric-only port: Forge/NeoForge platform code and
the SpectreLib dependency are dropped; config is plain JSON
(config/veinmining.json) with the original options and defaults.

Forge port for Minecraft 1.20.1 (Forge 47.4.20) by Itamio.
Full original logic ported: code-registered enchantment, vein-mining
logic, mixins, config (JSON), and networking via Forge SimpleChannel.
